{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881590/extras/propgif1.gif?t=1739450781\" /><strong>PropFight</strong> is a 2D physics-based fighting game where you play random props in random arenas where random events occur. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2-8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local multiplayer (online is only supported with Remote Play)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highly customizable game settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt;80 arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt;10 props</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt;10 events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam workshop support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Input support (fallback to classic input support is possible)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modding is officially supported  using the <strong>Godot Engine</strong> and our development tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2881590?t=1739450781","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881590/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739450781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881590/165252464bb50478ab83e94b83815744c68f3a36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739450781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881590/165252464bb50478ab83e94b83815744c68f3a36/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739450781","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"desc